    "_` Akuma Mode",
    "- On the Character Select Screen _O_S_+^F_+^I",
    "_` Dramatic Battle Mode (ARCADE only)",
    "- On the Character Select Screen",
    "- 1P side must put the cursor on Ryu _O_S, and press _8_8, release _S and press _8_8_+^E",
    "- 2P side must put the cursor on Ken _O_S, and press _8_8, release _S and press _8_8_+^G",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "_` Game Options (CPS Changer only)",
    "- On any screen _O_S_+^S",
    "_` URA MODE (CPS Changer only)",
    "- Start the game and ^2 _+ _O @L-button _+ @R-button on 2P side",
    "- Unlocks all Characters",
    "- Unlocks Game Speed Slow 1, Slow 2, Turbo 3 and Turbo 4",
    "_` CPU Route Select (CPS Changer only)",
    "- On the Title Screen _O @X-button and press _S",
    "- URA MODE must be activated first",
    "_` Dramatic Battle Mode (CPS Changer only)",
    "- On the Character Select Screen _O_S, and press _8_8, release _S and press _8_8",
    "- 1P side must select his character with @L-button",
    "- 2P side must select his character with @R-button",
    "- Only on a 2P Game",
    "- URA MODE must be activated first",
    "_` Tokoton Mode (CPS Changer only)",
